      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "An engineer is troubleshooting an EoMPLS circuit on a Cisco IOS XR router interface that removes a VLAN from the distribution layer. Which configuration should the engineer apply in order to accomplish the task?"
